Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.18,0:02:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I was landing I saw some old ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.10,0:02:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're down the road\Nabout five clicks south.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.62,0:02:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looked like a good place to make\Na stand and not get surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.10,0:02:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll all up there then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.34,0:02:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The vr mmo community\Nin the states is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.62,0:02:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think this is all that\Nwe're available now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.64,0:02:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we beat them, maybe whoever's behind\Nthis will think twice about sending more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.90,0:02:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right then, I'll bomb\Nthe heck out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.76,0:02:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh by the way, um, is\Nit okay if I see kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.46,0:02:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you asking permission for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.58,0:02:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's here in the wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.52,0:02:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh he is then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.82,0:02:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll go in and say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.76,0:03:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Solus? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.62,0:03:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm not who you think I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.22,0:03:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just borrowing this\Noutfit for a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.00,0:03:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Sinon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.06,0:03:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.22,0:03:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm from the real world, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.10,0:03:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.22,0:03:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Kirito, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.86,0:03:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm his friend. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.64,0:03:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many women friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.74,0:03:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's got even more back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.40,0:04:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your soul might be broken and you\Nmight not remember who you were,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.66,0:04:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but all your friends do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.24,0:04:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, can you feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.76,0:04:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Kirito I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.22,0:04:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sarcastic prankster,\Nstubborn and sometimes immature,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.68,0:04:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the strongest, most\Nkind person I ever knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.68,0:04:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be back and better than ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.60,0:04:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in the nick of time, as usual?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.16,0:04:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Asuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.72,0:04:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be back in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.94,0:04:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to check those ruins out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure they're really safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.32,0:04:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fly right back and\Nlet you know if they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.18,0:04:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.42,0:04:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I hear that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.64,0:04:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.70,0:04:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.14,0:05:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said the Solus\Naccount had the power to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.24,0:05:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's no time\Nlimit on it or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.98,0:05:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about us then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to get Alice back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.18,0:05:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Emperor's got her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.72,0:05:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you hurry, you can catch them!
