Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.44,0:05:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were we fighting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.84,0:05:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.04,0:05:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you all have to die for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.56,0:05:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.76,0:06:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always have the worst\Nluck with new gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.06,0:06:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me straighten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.08,0:06:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.06,0:06:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, or morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.34,0:06:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.98,0:06:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be scared of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.02,0:06:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.32,0:06:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.90,0:06:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I be scared of another human?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.58,0:06:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.16,0:06:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm no human.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.76,0:06:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something wrong with your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.58,0:06:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see I'm orc?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.14,0:06:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you white humans called big people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're human as far as I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.68,0:06:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're standing there talking,\Nso that pretty much makes you human.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.20,0:06:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.56,0:06:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.84,0:06:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know where we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.30,0:07:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.76,0:07:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot to ask your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.32,0:07:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Lil' Pillan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.92,0:07:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lil' Pillan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.83,0:07:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.96,0:07:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.28,0:07:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.32,0:07:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Leafa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.66,0:07:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Human.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what your name is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.50,0:07:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're my prisoner now, and\NI'm taking you to the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.82,0:07:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this Emperor of yours\Nalso the Dark God Vecta?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.96,0:07:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okie dokie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let you take me to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.38,0:07:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talking makes me human. This girl's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the goblins ogres and giants can all talk
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too but humans treat a lot of us like we
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lower than dirt all the\Nsame so why don't she
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.28,0:08:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come on
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.66,0:08:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.52,0:08:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's D.E.L!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.48,0:08:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The smell!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the smell!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.26,0:08:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The scent of life is strong in this one
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.64,0:08:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you've captured a wonderful specimen!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.48,0:08:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed well done little\Npink person well done to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.44,0:08:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,celebrate I shall reward\Nyou with some entertainment!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.68,0:09:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,assume you've
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.59,0:09:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never seen
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.51,0:09:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a human woman's body before
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.76,0:09:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this must be quite the\Ntreat for your piggy eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.86,0:09:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the fun is only\Nstarting keep watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.50,0:09:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Transfer human unit durability.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.96,0:09:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Left to self!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.52,0:09:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her life is so thick and sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.02,0:09:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.10,0:09:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That eel is my prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.60,0:09:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was gonna take her to the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.38,0:09:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence, filthy wretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.66,0:09:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten that His Majesty\Nput all of His forces under my command?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My will is His will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.00,0:09:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as long as I live,\Nyou will obey my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.52,0:10:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, her life surges. It\Nis overflowing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.82,0:10:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is mine, life is mine forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.28,0:10:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't die here, but she can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.52,0:10:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to kill an Underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.54,0:10:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave her alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.90,0:10:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave her alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.12,0:10:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.03,0:10:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that an order?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.18,0:11:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.48,0:11:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know your place, Piggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.58,0:11:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is my prisoner now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.64,0:11:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And whether I decide to suck the life from
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.90,0:11:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her or snap her neck\Nis no concern of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.06,0:11:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On second thought, you\Nwere the one who found her,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so perhaps a slight\Nconcession is in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.04,0:11:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But only if you strip\Nnaked before me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.06,0:11:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.36,0:11:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since I first saw you strutting\Naround in those ridiculous garments,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.60,0:11:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so repulsed I quite nearly gagged.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.48,0:11:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mere pig trying to pass as human.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.70,0:11:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strip for me. Get down\Non all fours and squeal
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.88,0:11:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then perhaps I might\Nlet you have her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.38,0:11:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're human as far as I can tell. I\Nmean, you're standing there talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.72,0:12:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.63,0:12:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.72,0:12:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.18,0:12:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But really, it's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, pig. Stir it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.74,0:12:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or are you having second thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the sight of her in this state\Narouses you and you're too ashamed too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.02,0:12:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm up. I'm up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.90,0:12:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.00,0:12:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.82,0:13:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You rotten treasonous swine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.76,0:13:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dare raise your weapon against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.46,0:13:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll chop you up into little chunks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.16,0:13:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mix your carcass with hay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.74,0:13:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That made you to the board!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.12,0:13:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can a human slash\Nanother human to save a pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.62,0:13:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're evil, and I'll\Nslash evil to save a human!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.48,0:14:02.86,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs62\c&HF9F6FE&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.7\pos(966,873.2)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)}D{\alpha&HFF&\t(13,133,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(27,147,\alpha&H00&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(41,161,\alpha&H00&)}k {\alpha&HFF&\t(55,175,\alpha&H00&)}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(69,189,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(83,203,\alpha&H00&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(96,216,\alpha&H00&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(110,230,\alpha&H00&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(124,244,\alpha&H00&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(138,258,\alpha&H00&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(152,272,\alpha&H00&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(166,286,\alpha&H00&)}y{\alpha&HFF&\t(180,300,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(193,313,\alpha&H00&)}S{\alpha&HFF&\t(207,327,\alpha&H00&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(221,341,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(235,355,\alpha&H00&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(249,369,\alpha&H00&)}h{\alpha&HFF&\t(263,383,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(276,396,\alpha&H00&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(290,410,\alpha&H00&)}n {\alpha&HFF&\t(304,424,\alpha&H00&)}R{\alpha&HFF&\t(318,438,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(332,452,\alpha&H00&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(346,466,\alpha&H00&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(360,480,\alpha&H00&)}s
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.60,0:14:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please keep an eye on\NKirito while I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.08,0:14:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll keep him safe no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.20,0:14:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't let anyone near him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll guard him with our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.78,0:14:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.00,0:14:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't let the enemy get this far in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.92,0:14:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.90,0:14:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.36,0:15:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, she's vicious when\Nshe's got her game face on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.70,0:15:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Racking up the kills\Nlike there's no tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.30,0:15:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.28,0:15:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm switching dragons and\NI still can't catch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.58,0:15:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have the power to\Nheal his dragon's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.76,0:15:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time-splitting sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.38,0:15:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a sorry dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.12,0:15:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poragiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.46,0:16:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or her Uragiri slashes the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.46,0:16:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever that bastard is,\Nhe can't rewind time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.88,0:16:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I get cut down, head back\Nto the others and help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.96,0:16:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emperor Vecta. Not all\Nreal-worlders are demons like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.76,0:16:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Asuna girl's proof of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.78,0:16:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You whipped up the Dark Territory\Nand drove its people to war.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.54,0:16:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You caused the deaths of tens\Nof thousands of them, and us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.30,0:16:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as humans go, that right\Nthere's proof you're evil to the core.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.32,0:16:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.62,0:16:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna feel the\Nweight of every life lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.70,0:16:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.22,0:16:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slippery bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.36,0:17:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time splitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.32,0:17:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sword Karagiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.34,0:17:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can absorb incarnation abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.94,0:17:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what it's called incarnate\Nyour fusion of mind and will?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.38,0:17:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yours tastes like a\Nvintage wine rich thick
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.62,0:17:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heavy with a finish that\Nlingers a bit. Too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.96,0:17:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not my favorite, but as a palate\Ncleanser before the main course, it's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.44,0:18:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let me drink more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.76,0:18:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You choke on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.86,0:18:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.74,0:18:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was about to do something, but I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.42,0:18:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.72,0:18:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I let my\Nmind wander like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.86,0:18:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.34,0:19:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You leashed my incarnate\Nability right out of my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.42,0:19:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a nifty trick\Nyou pulled just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.44,0:19:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we can't cross swords, we're\Ngoing to be here all day, your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.88,0:19:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.79,0:19:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That reminds me, I have\Nanother trick to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.16,0:19:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.18,0:19:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He clouded my mind just\Nby pointing a sword at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.08,0:19:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I counter that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.58,0:19:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used Karagiri and that didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.52,0:19:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only other skill I got is Ura-Giri.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.30,0:19:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's not going to stand\Nthere as I fire it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.98,0:19:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever felt you were going to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.68,0:20:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this is where it's supposed to\Nhappen, I'll make it count, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.90,0:20:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.08,0:20:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I did it right, but I'd\Ntry to be some kind of father to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.34,0:20:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even remember mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.20,0:20:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's not like I had a clue as\Nto what being a dad's all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.86,0:20:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's one thing I do know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.56,0:20:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A good father would give\Nhis life to protect his kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.38,0:20:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's something you're\Nnever gonna understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.12,0:20:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.76,0:20:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, this game sucks so much ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.78,0:20:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might as well log out and go back to...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I can stand,\NI'm going to keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.44,0:21:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come on, if you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.28,0:21:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do this all day\Nif I have to. Get her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.26,0:21:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. There's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.92,0:21:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.34,0:21:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a sword skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.80,0:21:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.02,0:21:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.36,0:21:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.74,0:21:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Klein?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.42,0:22:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.76,0:22:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.74,0:22:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.14,0:22:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm scared to be afraid of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.32,0:22:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this sweet world, I'll see you soon!
